WEBVTT

00:03:58.517 --> 00:04:01.713
Let me talk about brands for a moment,
since some of you run brands.

00:04:01.737 --> 00:04:04.001
Every brand is out there
making sound right now.

00:04:04.025 --> 00:04:07.382
There are eight expressions of a brand
in sound; they're all important.

00:04:07.406 --> 00:04:10.026
And every brand needs to have
guidelines at the center.

00:04:10.050 --> 00:04:12.309
I'm glad to say
that is starting to happen now.

00:04:12.333 --> 00:04:13.911
(Intel ad jingle)

00:04:13.935 --> 00:04:15.500
You all recognize that one.

00:04:15.524 --> 00:04:16.531
(Nokia ringtone)

00:04:16.555 --> 00:04:19.047
This is the most-played tune
in the world today --

00:04:19.071 --> 00:04:21.279
1.8 billion times a day,
that tune is played.

00:04:21.303 --> 00:04:22.359
(Laughter)

00:04:22.383 --> 00:04:24.741
And it cost Nokia absolutely nothing.

00:04:24.765 --> 00:04:28.317
I'll leave you with four golden rules,
for those of you who run businesses,

00:04:28.341 --> 00:04:29.497
for commercial sound.

00:04:29.521 --> 00:04:30.976
First, make it congruent,